    "detailed_description": "Dark Prison 7th is a VR escape game with some horror elements. Dark Prison 7th has very simple rules. You just need to reach the 7th floor of the prison, where the exit is!<br><br>Explore and observe the endlessly repeating prison interior spaces.<br><br>[Single Player]<br><br>The game supports first-person single player mode.<br><br>[Elevator]<br><br>If nothing is wrong in the prison, take the elevator going up.<br><br>However, if anything has changed from the beginning, take the elevator going down!<br><br>If you make the wrong choice, you will return to the very first floor.<br><br>[Immersion]<br><br>You will be immersed in realistic graphics and a spooky atmosphere.<br><br>Players can use the 'headlight' to illuminate their surroundings.<br><br>[Various Gimmicks]<br><br>Dark Prison 7th has a total of 28 paranormal phenomena. Pay attention to ambient noise, objects, and even people. Never let your guard down.<br><br>It will be quite difficult and scary.<br><br>I sincerely hope you make the right choice.",
    "about_the_game": "Dark Prison 7th is a VR escape game with some horror elements. Dark Prison 7th has very simple rules. You just need to reach the 7th floor of the prison, where the exit is!<br><br>Explore and observe the endlessly repeating prison interior spaces.<br><br>[Single Player]<br><br>The game supports first-person single player mode.<br><br>[Elevator]<br><br>If nothing is wrong in the prison, take the elevator going up.<br><br>However, if anything has changed from the beginning, take the elevator going down!<br><br>If you make the wrong choice, you will return to the very first floor.<br><br>[Immersion]<br><br>You will be immersed in realistic graphics and a spooky atmosphere.<br><br>Players can use the 'headlight' to illuminate their surroundings.<br><br>[Various Gimmicks]<br><br>Dark Prison 7th has a total of 28 paranormal phenomena. Pay attention to ambient noise, objects, and even people. Never let your guard down.<br><br>It will be quite difficult and scary.<br><br>I sincerely hope you make the right choice.",
    "short_description": "You are trapped alone in a mysterious prison. After carefully examining your surroundings, you must take the elevator to reach the 7th floor of the prison. However, if you notice any anomalies, take the elevator down. Escape from the prison filled with strange phenomena!",
